%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-dates-functions-atbeginningofyear (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  {
    "atBeginningOfYearDateTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00.000-03:00"
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::core::Dates
output application/json
---
{
  atBeginningOfYearDateTime: atBeginningOfYear(|2020-10-06T18:23:20.351-03:00|)
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "atBeginningOfYearDateTime": "2020-01-01T00:00:00-03:00"
}
